{"id":"3c61920d957fb9dd","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-forcing12-support-iteration-condition.md","title":"ZFC Forcing12 Support Iteration Condition","display":"df-zfc-forcing12-support-iteration-condition — ZFC Forcing12 Support Iteration Condition","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing12-support-iteration-condition","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing12-support-iteration-condition"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing12-support-iteration-condition — ZFC Forcing12 Support Iteration Condition","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-forcing-notion.md]]","[[58-df-name]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing12-support-iteration-condition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing12-support-iteration-condition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing12-support-iteration-condition — ZFC Forcing12 Support Iteration Condition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"46b2495f214783c3\" href=\"?note=46b2495f214783c3\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md\">../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d413862f4ab047c8\" href=\"?note=d413862f4ab047c8\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-forcing-notion.md\">../batch13/58-df-forcing-notion.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ec28b62254928d73\" href=\"?note=ec28b62254928d73\" title=\"58-df-name\">58-df-name</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\delta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> (iteration length)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq\\delta\">\\(S\\subseteq\\delta\\)</span> (allowed support coordinates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> (ground model)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_\\bullet\">\\(P_\\bullet\\)</span> (sequence of set-coded stage forcing notions) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot Q_\\bullet\">\\(\\dot Q_\\bullet\\)</span> (sequence of iterand names), both with domain <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta\">\\(\\delta\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> (set-coded partial function)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\Vdash_{M,P_\\alpha}\\varphi\">\\(q\\Vdash_{M,P_\\alpha}\\varphi\\)</span> (stage forcing relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"46b2495f214783c3\" href=\"?note=46b2495f214783c3\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md\">../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ForcingNotion}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ForcingNotion}_S\\)</span> (forcing-notion predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d413862f4ab047c8\" href=\"?note=d413862f4ab047c8\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-forcing-notion.md\">../batch13/58-df-forcing-notion.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Name}(\\tau,P_\\alpha)\">\\(\\mathrm{Name}(\\tau,P_\\alpha)\\)</span> (forcing-name predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ec28b62254928d73\" href=\"?note=ec28b62254928d73\" title=\"58-df-name\">58-df-name</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (set-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SupportIterationCondition}\">\\(\\operatorname{SupportIterationCondition}\\)</span> (predicate defined below)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing12\\text{-}support\\text{-}iteration\\text{-}condition}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{SupportIterationCondition}(p,M,\\delta,S,P_\\bullet,\\dot Q_\\bullet)\\leftrightarrow\n\\delta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\land S\\subseteq\\delta\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(P_\\bullet,\\delta,\\operatorname{ran}(P_\\bullet))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\dot Q_\\bullet,\\delta,\\operatorname{ran}(\\dot Q_\\bullet))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(p,\\operatorname{dom}(p),\\operatorname{ran}(p))\n\\land\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\subseteq S\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\delta\\;\\exists P_\\alpha,\\leq_\\alpha,\\mathbb1_\\alpha\\;\\Bigl(\nP_\\bullet(\\alpha)=\\langle P_\\alpha,\\leq_\\alpha,\\mathbb1_\\alpha\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{ForcingNotion}_S(P_\\bullet(\\alpha))\n\\land\\mathrm{Name}(\\dot Q_\\bullet(\\alpha),P_\\alpha)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\;\\exists P_\\alpha,\\leq_\\alpha,\\mathbb1_\\alpha\\;\\Bigl(\nP_\\bullet(\\alpha)=\\langle P_\\alpha,\\leq_\\alpha,\\mathbb1_\\alpha\\rangle\n\\land p{\\upharpoonright}\\alpha\\in P_\\alpha\n\\land\\mathrm{Name}(p(\\alpha),P_\\alpha)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{13em}\\land (p{\\upharpoonright}\\alpha)\\Vdash_{M,P_\\alpha}\\bigl(p(\\alpha)\\in\\dot Q_\\bullet(\\alpha)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing12\\text{-}support\\text{-}iteration\\text{-}condition}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{SupportIterationCondition}(p,M,\\delta,S,P_\\bullet,\\dot Q_\\bullet)\\leftrightarrow\n\\delta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\land S\\subseteq\\delta\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(P_\\bullet,\\delta,\\operatorname{ran}(P_\\bullet))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\dot Q_\\bullet,\\delta,\\operatorname{ran}(\\dot Q_\\bullet))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(p,\\operatorname{dom}(p),\\operatorname{ran}(p))\n\\land\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\subseteq S\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\delta\\;\\exists P_\\alpha,\\leq_\\alpha,\\mathbb1_\\alpha\\;\\Bigl(\nP_\\bullet(\\alpha)=\\langle P_\\alpha,\\leq_\\alpha,\\mathbb1_\\alpha\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{ForcingNotion}_S(P_\\bullet(\\alpha))\n\\land\\mathrm{Name}(\\dot Q_\\bullet(\\alpha),P_\\alpha)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\;\\exists P_\\alpha,\\leq_\\alpha,\\mathbb1_\\alpha\\;\\Bigl(\nP_\\bullet(\\alpha)=\\langle P_\\alpha,\\leq_\\alpha,\\mathbb1_\\alpha\\rangle\n\\land p{\\upharpoonright}\\alpha\\in P_\\alpha\n\\land\\mathrm{Name}(p(\\alpha),P_\\alpha)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{13em}\\land (p{\\upharpoonright}\\alpha)\\Vdash_{M,P_\\alpha}\\bigl(p(\\alpha)\\in\\dot Q_\\bullet(\\alpha)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This atom uses the partial-function convention in which the domain of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> is its support; trivial coordinates are omitted. Each stage datum is unpacked as a forcing notion, the iterand and coordinate values are typed as <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_\\alpha\">\\(P_\\alpha\\)</span>-names, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\upharpoonright\\alpha\">\\(p\\upharpoonright\\alpha\\)</span> is required to be a stage condition before it appears on the left of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Vdash_{M,P_\\alpha}\">\\(\\Vdash_{M,P_\\alpha}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"46b2495f214783c3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-forcing-notion.md","status":"resolved","id":"d413862f4ab047c8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-forcing-notion.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-name","status":"resolved","id":"ec28b62254928d73","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-name]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"46b2495f214783c3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$q\\Vdash_{M,P_\\alpha}\\varphi$ (stage forcing relation, see [[../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-forcing-notion.md","status":"resolved","id":"d413862f4ab047c8","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ForcingNotion}_S$ (forcing-notion predicate, see [[../batch13/58-df-forcing-notion.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-name","status":"resolved","id":"ec28b62254928d73","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Name}(\\tau,P_\\alpha)$ (forcing-name predicate, see [[58-df-name]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (set-funct